      "kind": "report",
      "version": "2026-04",
      "tags": [
        "regulatory",
        "change-control",
        "notification",
        "impact"
      ],
      "summary": "Every change to a process, material, site or specification is raised as a change request and assessed by quality, production and regulatory affairs. Regulatory affairs decides whether the change needs a notification or prior approval. The change is implemented only after that decision is filed.",
